window.THINGS = [{"n":1,"title":"Your laugh.","text":"I’ve heard it a thousand times and I still try to cause it on purpose.","photo":"e28"},{"n":2,"title":"The face you make when you win an argument.","text":"Which is most of them.","photo":"e10"},{"n":3,"title":"You tell me the truth.","text":"About the gym, about studying, about me. Nobody makes me better the way you do.","photo":"e30"},{"n":4,"title":"You’re calm when I’m not.","text":"When I wanted to fight the whole world, you were the one saying “let them bark, we move on.” You were right.","photo":"e25"},{"n":5,"title":"The thousand nicknames.","text":"MD, veg boy, totla, Batman, best friend. I answer to all of them.","photo":"e15"},{"n":6,"title":"You write better than anyone I know.","text":"I keep every letter you’ve ever given me, the 52 cards and the tic-tac-toe one included.","photo":null},{"n":7,"title":"You’re three places at once.","text":"Thai roots, born in Orange County, a Mumbai girl. Somehow all three, perfectly.","photo":null},{"n":8,"title":"Wordle is a sport to you.","text":"Connections, Strands, the Mini. You play them like there’s prize money, so I made you your own.","photo":"e29"},{"n":9,"title":"Your snack rankings.","text":"Lays Salt & Vinegar, Takis, Dinamita, Masala Magic, the red tomato ones. Delivered with total confidence.","photo":null},{"n":10,"title":"Nutella.","text":"You love it more than most people. This year the jar finally has the right name on it.","photo":null},{"n":11,"title":"Your music.","text":"Don Toliver on repeat, “You” by Lloyd, “Raindance.” Our blend is mostly you, and I wouldn’t change it.","photo":"e31"},{"n":12,"title":"Baby pink.","text":"Everything you love turns baby pink. I’m navy blue. We match better than we should.","photo":"e02"},{"n":13,"title":"You dream big.","text":"Norway and the northern lights, the perfect Italian dinner. You plan our future like it’s already booked. I’m in.","photo":"e20"},{"n":14,"title":"Horror movies.","text":"I’ll watch anything scary if it means sitting next to you.","photo":"e07"},{"n":15,"title":"Catwoman to my Batman.","text":"Slightly dangerous, very stylish, always on my side.","photo":"e06"},{"n":16,"title":"We keep it between us.","text":"We sort things out privately, and we never go to sleep upset. That is rare, and it’s ours.","photo":null},{"n":17,"title":"You let me chase you.","text":"Not jog, not walk, chase. Seven years of almosts and you still said yes. Best thing I’ve ever done.","photo":"e18"}];
window.LETTER = {"greeting":"E,","body":["Happy 17th birthday. I’ve restarted this letter about nine times, which you’ll find funny, because you’re the one who’s good at writing and I’m the one who sends “love youuu soooo much” with four typos in it.","So here’s the simple version. A long time ago, a kid at Oberoi in neon glasses decided you were the coolest person in the building. He was right. He just took a very long time to do anything about it. We started talking, stopped, started again, stopped again, and then one day it finally stuck. I’ve been grateful for that every single day since.","This year you’ve been my favourite person to do absolutely nothing with: ranking chips like it’s a serious debate, horror movies, planning Norway and the perfect Italian dinner like we’ve already booked them, and a Spotify blend that is mostly Don Toliver at this point. You’ve also made me better. You push me about the gym and studying, you tell me the truth to my face even when I don’t want to hear it, and you never let me settle for less than I can be. Not many people would do that for me.","Seventeen looks really good on you. I hope this is the year everything you’ve been working for starts falling into place, and I’ll be right next to you for all of it, cheering the loudest. On the 5th of December it’ll be one year of us, and honestly, I feel like we’re just getting started.","Happy birthday, baby. I love you more than I can fit on a page, which is why I made you a whole book instead."],"closing":"Yours, always,","sign":"M"};
